  "html": "<!-- TODO (EJ): add your voice — this is a factual stub, not your words. Draft until ready. -->\n<p class=\"\">A tool for quickly prototyping AR / lens visualizations and HUDs — drag data widgets onto left/right lenses to compose a heads-up display from live bio, motion, location, environment, and device signals.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Scrolling the HUD — lenses up top, then the full widget drawer\" class=\"\"><video class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/so_0,f_jpg,q_auto,w_1280/projects/glasses-hud/demo.jpg\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/q_auto/projects/glasses-hud/demo.mp4\" aria-label=\"Scrolling the HUD — lenses up top, then the full widget drawer\"></video><figcaption class=\"\">Scrolling the HUD — lenses up top, then the full widget drawer</figcaption></figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Body widgets — heart rate, HRV, blood oxygen, calories\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/glasses-hud/body.png\" alt=\"Body widgets — heart rate, HRV, blood oxygen, calories\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/glasses-hud/body.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/glasses-hud/body.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/glasses-hud/body.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/glasses-hud/body.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Body widgets — heart rate, HRV, blood oxygen, calories\" width=\"1960\" height=\"800\" style=\"--splay-rot:2.62deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1960×800\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-